#
# Copy this to .github/allowed_signers and list the keys that may sign a
# release tag. With this file present, the release workflow verifies who
# signed the tag; without it, it can only check that a signature is there.
#
# One line per signer, in the format git's gpg.ssh.allowedSignersFile takes:
#
#   name@example.org namespaces="git" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAA...
